# Frontend

## Styling — NativeWind target
- **New files:** `className` for layout, color, spacing, typography.
- **Legacy (current codebase):** most UI still uses `StyleSheet` + `COLORS`/`SPACING`. When touching a file, migrate via `migrate-nativewind` skill.
- **Project-wide pass:** `frontend/bulk-nativewind-migration` skill.
- `StyleSheet.create` **only** for shadows/elevation (`SHADOWS` from theme).
- Tokens: `bg-bg`, `text-t-1`, `text-gold`, `p-4`, `rounded-md` — see `tailwind.config.js`.

## Screens
- Root wrapper: `SafeAreaView` with `className="flex-1 bg-bg"` (after migration).
- Granular Zustand selectors — never `useGameStore(s => s.character)` whole object.
- No game logic in screens — call store actions only.
- Nav types from `RootStackParamList` / `MainTabParamList` in `src/types/index.ts`.

## Components
- Props-driven; no direct store access.
- Export shared primitives via `src/components/index.tsx` barrel.
- `accessibilityLabel` on all `Pressable` / interactive elements.

## Lists & performance
- `FlatList` or `SectionList` for lists > 10 items.
- Haptic feedback on state-changing buttons.

## Skill shortcuts
- New screen → `frontend/new-screen`
- Single-file migration → `frontend/migrate-nativewind`
- Bulk migration → `frontend/bulk-nativewind-migration`
- New route → `frontend/add-navigation-route`
